@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Application availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Database availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/db

### Create ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Не открывается личный кабинет",
  "description": "При входе появляется сообщение об ошибке"
}

### List tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets

### Get created ticket (replace 1 with returned id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1

### Set status (replace 1 with returned id)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "InProgress"
}
